# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits:
#  S103 KBM: a modifier (Shift / Control / Alt) bound as a bare token in any keybind_* is a button (fires on its own, no longer picks the chord, a chord using it still needs it held); no bare modifier bound = the old exact-modifier rule; the pure match helpers moved to include/rex/input/mnk/bind_match.h (host test: tools/input/kbm_bind_test.cpp)
